                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I know I'm not part of MENSA, but c'mon...\n\nI managed to beat 103 puzzles and just could NOT get past the mediums. I started bouncing around and after years of trying to beat this game I have finally given up. Easy is fun, the concept is good. It's a good game. Medium and Hard are insane. You can determine how to form words with consonant pairs but at a certain point you need to have a VAST vocabulary to 100% this game. I'm using a guide just now. \n\nSTOLID. The second/first word pair to solve required me to come up with STOLID. Next puzzle? BANYAN. I know what a banyan tree is, but that did NOT register in my head. Next puzzle? DIPPY, that is no better than STOLID, but guess what? Same puzzle as DIPPY? AGAR... The game doesn't even have a confirmation it is a valid word if you are unsure on whether or not STOLID is a real word.\n\nI enjoyed the easy puzzles, I am in the process of using a achievement guide to finish and uninstall this game after a decade of being unsolved in my library.",
